<h3>libOgg 1.2.2 released</h3>


<p>Xiph.Org is pleased to announce a full release of libogg 1.2.2.
This is a spot release that contains only build and documentation
fixes.

<p>Changes and fixes in the new libogg release include:

<ul>
<li> Build fix (types correction) for Mac OS X
<li> Update win32 project files to Visual Studio 2008
<li> ogg_stream_pageout_fill documentation fix
</ul>

<p>This release contains no library code changes, only a type
correction in a header to allow successful builds on Mac OS X.  A
similar type change without practical effect was made for correctness
purposes on BEOS.

<p>Tarballs and zipfiles of the official release can be found in the
usual place
at <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/ogg">http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/ogg/</a>.

<p>Happy hacking!

<p>Monty
<br>Xiph.Org

<p><i> The Xiph.Org Foundation is a not-for-profit corporation
